1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,449
The evidence meeting was held tonight because the news could not wait, and the argument on the table was about a defective pearl.

2
00:00:07,449 --> 00:00:12,617
“I believe the report and I cannot approve it,” the auditor said.

3
00:00:12,617 --> 00:00:20,176
“Everything upon it rests on one page, and that page was written prior to the test.”

4
00:00:20,176 --> 00:00:26,999
The dispute concerning the twentieth chapter was simple: accept the figure or deny it.

5
00:00:26,999 --> 00:00:31,403
“You insist that we respond tonight,” Lin said.

6
00:00:31,403 --> 00:00:43,376
“I would rather remind you that a compelling thesis can still be wrong.” A generous reader would argue the same point, and a cop at the door would not.

7
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:46,785
The group had promised not to pretend.

8
00:00:46,785 --> 00:00:53,039
“We will declare the error and we will not seize the moment to look good,” Maya wrote.

9
00:00:53,039 --> 00:01:00,617
“Onto every page we will put the name of the person who checked it, and okay means checked.”

10
00:01:00,617 --> 00:01:14,634
The prior year had been wound backwards: a nightly habit of re-doing each report, an entrepreneurial push that frightened the volunteers, and a forgetful editor who had misplaced one page.

11
00:01:14,634 --> 00:01:21,938
“Weep if you like,” the auditor said, “but stabilize the process first.”

12
00:01:21,938 --> 00:01:27,757
The surrounding argument was about the underwear factory and the couple who owned it.

13
00:01:27,757 --> 00:01:33,105
“It is too easy to rob a small firm of its name,” Lin said.

14
00:01:33,105 --> 00:01:40,099
“A fine is not the same as a fair verdict, and an exception is not a rule.”

15
00:01:40,099 --> 00:01:50,657
The choice of the twentieth chapter was to publish everything except the private correspondence, and to try the whole record against the purpose it claimed.

16
00:01:50,657 --> 00:01:58,695
“A generous account is not a flattering one,” the auditor said, and the meeting closed without an argument.

17
00:01:58,695 --> 00:02:05,938
Age is different from death, and during the year we decided to keep every point about the effect.

18
00:02:05,938 --> 00:02:14,516
The fine was never news, the purpose was never just, and the couple who built it seemed to be under a different sky.

19
00:02:14,516 --> 00:02:27,634
The choice was to decide during the same meeting, and to choose the harder option; it was never only about the fine, and the news, the point, and the effect were the same as before.

20
00:02:27,634 --> 00:02:37,372
Although we cannot swear to every page, we welcome the check, and we will not entertain a version that hides it.
